PARITY_UNIT=behavior:android/live-sse-lifecycle (ADR-009 live-data foundation; not a page — out of scope: page layout)
Acceptance coverage:
  [x] SSE connects only while app foreground (ProcessLifecycleOwner) AND authenticated AND a page observes; cancels cleanly.
  [x] Reconnect + Last-Event-ID handled by the shared client (LiveFeedSseClientTest proves the adapter surfaces both).
  [x] Auth gating + re-auth on token refresh/401 (authenticated gate reopen; retry nudges token refresh) — no per-page token code.
  [x] Stale >2 min surfaced (Connection.Stale -> isStale) WITHOUT dropping the stream or hiding panels (last-known retained).
  [x] Connection states mapped into A2 LiveIndicator (LiveConnectionIndicator) + LiveStaleDataBanner (LiveStaleBanner) with retry.
  [x] Live panels get stale/error indicators instead of blank content (status/isStale + empty-not-null LiveVehicleState).
  [x] Localized labels (live_strings.xml); single redacting logger only, redacted metadata (ADR-016).
